evious 252 common observations' 80th percentile. Require prior observation at most four calendar days old. No inverse arm, stops, leverage optimization or parameter sweep. Fixed 0.02 lots, spread, 20-point adverse slippage each side, ECN commission. Compare mean net P&L with long-only random dates drawn within year with equal counts. Test 2011\u20132015, 2016\u20132020, 2021\u20132025. Existing PF gates apply. Historical screen only.\n\n", "start": "2011-01-01"}